## r11 QA11-G4 note: fails only because this sandbox sets TMPDIR=/tmp/claude-0 (and /tmp itself is read-only), so the test's own join(tmpdir(),'..','etc','gitconfig') = /tmp/etc/gitconfig, which is legitimately inside the guard's scratch /tmp (the hook runs with TMPDIR unset). Test-design artefact, not a product defect; the r12 suite re-expresses the case with an absolute /etc path (QA12-G1).
## r2-r8 and base suite failures: same fixture drift (settings.json) plus earlier-documented rule drift (see round-11/03 log, identical pre-existing failure sets for r2-r7).
